    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "chore/spec-39-step-10-design",
    "head_commit_message": "docs(decisions): Decisions 159 and 160, spec 39 step 10: a 25k-a-side target, work that follows change, then threads, off the main thread (Q26, Q24)\n\nDesigned from bench runs #56 to #62 on main at 1156225. The tick grows\nlinearly with squads but nearly quadratically with one squad's size, and\ntwo passes that change nothing (tend, the roster) are 44% of a 25k tick.\nStep 10 splits into 10a (measuring tools) to 10f (the options that change\noutcomes, benched against each other). Decision 160 lets a uniform\nsquad-level cadence (Q32) be benched, not adopted without the feel test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5s3n8EVLySQzaPQsh",
